{"4828340":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Snake: Gridbreaker","steam_appid":4828340,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4892260],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Snake, rebuilt as a combat roguelite.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat. Grow. Then break every rule the old game taught you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no tutorial. The Grid does not explain itself. It tests you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped inside a living grid loop that wants to keep you in. Every run is a fight to escape before the Grid adapts, surrounds you, and pulls you back.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/ee6f5c1f8812519cb2f17feb411a6043.avif?t=1793711551\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras_big\/ee6f5c1f8812519cb2f17feb411a6043.webp?t=1793711551 width=1560 height=86 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/c973218bc05856aa2f11e448c6a5830d.poster.avif?t=1793711551\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/c973218bc05856aa2f11e448c6a5830d.webm?t=1793711551\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/c973218bc05856aa2f11e448c6a5830d.mp4?t=1793711551\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow longer. Get stronger. Then start cheating the system.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your tail into a weapon: burn, shock, freeze, bite, devour.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\