loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/71678050502123e529e73574b25bcb97.poster.avif?t=1793711551\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/71678050502123e529e73574b25bcb97.webm?t=1793711551\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/71678050502123e529e73574b25bcb97.mp4?t=1793711551\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick, stack and evolve over 80 upgrades. Find strange powerups.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take cursed mutations: power at a price.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/d74269009e0a5a7d0297e0da25a888ae.avif?t=1793711551\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras_big\/d74269009e0a5a7d0297e0da25a888ae.webp?t=1793711551 width=1560 height=86 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/09a8e5e164e49bbc2377c37c2de6ba2e.poster.avif?t=1793711551\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/09a8e5e164e49bbc2377c37c2de6ba2e.webm?t=1793711551\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/09a8e5e164e49bbc2377c37c2de6ba2e.mp4?t=1793711551\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 enemy types hunt you. Hazards reshape your route.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sector changes the pressure: Frozen Loop, Burned Sector, Wild Code, The Core, Broken Grid.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/744914d049b5931f9b85e73be22a36ca.avif?t=1793711551\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras_big\/744914d049b5931f9b85e73be22a36ca.webp?t=1793711551 width=1560 height=86 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/059ae83ea76b4d03f0d3060bf8d76b24.poster.avif?t=1793711551\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/059ae83ea76b4d03f0d3060bf8d76b24.webm?t=1793711551\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/059ae83ea76b4d03f0d3060bf8d76b24.mp4?t=1793711551\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gatekeepers stand between you and escape. Break them, and the Gridmaster comes for you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/959a9aec76645e5fa9120ff4820a6007.avif?t=1793711551\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras_big\/959a9aec76645e5fa9120ff4820a6007.webp?t=1793711551 width=1560 height=86 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/8e5674585f1ec30a0767bfac7f6fe9d4.poster.avif?t=1793711551\" width=800 height=448 ><source