e your route.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sector changes the pressure: Frozen Loop, Burned Sector, Wild Code, The Core, Broken Grid.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/744914d049b5931f9b85e73be22a36ca.avif?t=1793711551\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras_big\/744914d049b5931f9b85e73be22a36ca.webp?t=1793711551 width=1560 height=86 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/059ae83ea76b4d03f0d3060bf8d76b24.poster.avif?t=1793711551\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/059ae83ea76b4d03f0d3060bf8d76b24.webm?t=1793711551\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/059ae83ea76b4d03f0d3060bf8d76b24.mp4?t=1793711551\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gatekeepers stand between you and escape. Break them, and the Gridmaster comes for you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/959a9aec76645e5fa9120ff4820a6007.avif?t=1793711551\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras_big\/959a9aec76645e5fa9120ff4820a6007.webp?t=1793711551 width=1560 height=86 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/8e5674585f1ec30a0767bfac7f6fe9d4.poster.avif?t=1793711551\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/8e5674585f1ec30a0767bfac7f6fe9d4.webm?t=1793711551\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/8e5674585f1ec30a0767bfac7f6fe9d4.mp4?t=1793711551\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 permanent upgrades. Every run makes you stronger.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find shops, roulettes and secret rooms. Push deeper into the Grid.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/613f816a005f50a03a4719c2029dc19a.avif?t=1793711551\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras_big\/613f816a005f50a03a4719c2029dc19a.webp?t=1793711551 width=1560 height=86 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/7b3fd51abadf9546b8809714905c04d2.poster.avif?t=1793711551\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/7b3fd51abadf9546b8809714905c04d2.webm?t=1793711551\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/7b3fd51abadf9546b8809714905c04d2.mp4?t=1793711551\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break out. Or fail.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Loop wants you back.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras\/242175c1b39836a711b80e4c91744a2b.webp?t=1793711551\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/extras_big\/242175c1b39836a711b80e4c91744a2b.webp?t=1793711551 width=1560 height=35 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play the free demo now.<\/strong><\/p>","short_description":"There is no tutorial. And there won't be. I believe in you. I couldn't escape the Grid. Maybe you can. You are snake who eats apples. j\/k You want to escape the grid loop. BUT the LOOP wants to keep You in.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Polish<strong>*<\/strong>, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Italian, Portuguese - Brazil, Ukrainian, Czech, Hungarian, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/d5807893edef8fb4358c1ed413c24e84afd61bf8\/header.jpg?t=1793711551","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/7daea29a580f6db4a471c067faaea5a41acc2bda\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793711551","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4828340\/7daea29a580f6db4a471c067faaea5a41acc2bda\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793711551","website":"https:\/\/snake-gridbreaker.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel core i3 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4096 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel UHD Graphics 620 \/ NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti \/ AMD Radeon R7 360 or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1000 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recom